{"seq":2,"slug":"uuid7-time-bits","title":"UUIDv7 时间位与单调性实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/distributed-id-clock-ordering/uuid-ulid/uuid7-time-bits","wordCount":2084,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"uuidv7-时间位与单调性实现\">UUIDv7 时间位与单调性实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>RFC 9562（2024 年 5 月发布，取代 RFC 4122）为 UUIDv7 定义了精确的位布局，并且首次在标准里明确讨论了「同一毫秒内如何保证有序」这个问题——它给出了三种实现方法，让实现者按自己的权衡选择（来源：RFC 9562, §6.2 Monotonicity and Counters，定义三种方法：Fixed Bit-Length Dedicated Counter、Monotonic Random、Replace Leftmost Random Bits with Increased Clock Precision，<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9562.html）。这一节把布局算清楚，再逐个分析三种单调性路径的取舍。\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9562.html）。这一节把布局算清楚，再逐个分析三种单调性路径的取舍。</a></p>\n<p>UUIDv7 的 128 位分配如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位范围</th>\n<th>长度</th>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>127–80</td>\n<td>48</td>\n<td><code>unix_ts_ms</code></td>\n<td>毫秒级 Unix 时间戳，大端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>79–76</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td><code>ver</code></td>\n<td>版本号，固定 <code>0111</code>（7）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>75–64</td>\n<td>12</td>\n<td><code>rand_a</code></td>\n<td>随机位，可作计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>63–62</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><code>var</code></td>\n<td>变体，固定 <code>10</code>（RFC 9562 变体）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>61–0</td>\n<td>62</td>\n<td><code>rand_b</code></td>\n<td>随机位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>时间位 48 位的容量是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>48</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{48}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">48</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 毫秒，换算成年：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mrow><mi>y</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>s</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>48</mn></msup><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>365.25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2.815</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>14</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3.156</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>10</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> </mtext><mn>919</mn><mtext> 年</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{years} = \\frac{2^{48}}{1000 \\times 60 \\times 60 \\times 24 \\times 365.25} \\approx \\frac{2.815 \\times 10^{14}}{3.156 \\times 10^{10}} \\approx 8\\,919 \\text{ 年}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365.25</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">48</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2604em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.4911em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3.156</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2.815</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">14</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">919</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">年</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>从 1970 年起算到公元 10889 年，实际上永不耗尽。这是 UUIDv7 相对 Snowflake 的一个明显优势：不必为 epoch 选择和寿命做取舍。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;UUIDv7 生成&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;读当前毫秒 ts&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;ts == last_ts?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|否| D[&quot;rand_a 与 rand_b 全随机&lt;br/&gt;方法1 无保证但最简单&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|是| E{&quot;选择单调性方法&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|方法2| F[&quot;Monotonic Random&lt;br/&gt;rand_a 作计数器递增&lt;br/&gt;溢出则进位 rand_b&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|方法3| G[&quot;Replace Leftmost Random&lt;br/&gt;整段随机数加 1&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|方法1| H[&quot;允许同毫秒内无序&lt;br/&gt;排序按 ts 粗略&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; I[&quot;同一毫秒内严格有序&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I&#10;    H --&gt; J[&quot;同毫秒内顺序不确定&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"UUIDv7 生成\"] --&gt; B[\"读当前毫秒 ts\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"ts == last_ts?\"}\n    C --&gt;|否| D[\"rand_a 与 rand_b 全随机&lt;br/&gt;方法1 无保证但最简单\"]\n    C --&gt;|是| E{\"选择单调性方法\"}\n    E --&gt;|方法2| F[\"Monotonic Random&lt;br/&gt;rand_a 作计数器递增&lt;br/&gt;溢出则进位 rand_b\"]\n    E --&gt;|方法3| G[\"Replace Leftmost Random&lt;br/&gt;整段随机数加 1\"]\n    E --&gt;|方法1| H[\"允许同毫秒内无序&lt;br/&gt;排序按 ts 粗略\"]\n    F --&gt; I[\"同一毫秒内严格有序\"]\n    G --&gt; I\n    H --&gt; J[\"同毫秒内顺序不确定\"]</pre><h2 id=\"方法一-不保证单调-纯随机\">方法一：不保证单调（纯随机）</h2><p>最简单：每次生成都取当前毫秒填时间位，其余 74 位（<code>rand_a</code> 12 + <code>rand_b</code> 62）全部取随机数。RFC 9562 称这种方式不保证单调，<code>rand_a</code> 不充当计数器。</p>\n<p>它的排序保证是：不同毫秒生成的 ID 严格按时间排序；同一毫秒内生成的 ID 顺序不确定。</p>\n<p>这个「弱保证」在很多场景下够用。日志、事件去重、分布式追踪的 span id 都不要求同毫秒内有序，只要趋势递增即可（避免索引随机插入）。而且它有一个重要优点：无状态。不需要维护「上次的随机数」，不需要处理计数器进位与溢出，不会因为状态管理 bug 破坏唯一性。</p>\n<p>选它的判据是：你只需要趋势递增，不需要「在同一毫秒内比较两个 ID 得出先后」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"方法二-单调随机-计数器\">方法二：单调随机（计数器）</h2><p>RFC 9562 的 Method 2（Monotonic Random）把 <code>rand_a</code> 当作同毫秒内的计数器使用。</p>\n<p>规则是：每次在同一毫秒内生成新 ID 时，把「上次的随机数」加 1。当 <code>rand_a</code> 从 <code>0xFFF</code> 溢出时，进位到 <code>rand_b</code>（把 <code>rand_b</code> 加 1），而不是把时间位加 1。这样做的巧妙之处在于：即使同一毫秒内产生了超过 4096 个 ID，也没有破坏时间位的语义（时间位仍然是真实的毫秒），而是借用 <code>rand_b</code> 的空间继续递增。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export class MonotonicUuidV7 {&#10;  private lastMs = -1;&#10;  private seq = 0; // 使用 rand_a 的 12 位作为计数器&#10;&#10;  next(): Uint8Array {&#10;    const nowMs = Date.now();&#10;    if (nowMs === this.lastMs) {&#10;      this.seq += 1;&#10;      if (this.seq &gt; 0xfff) {&#10;        throw new Error(&#39;rand_a exhausted in this millisecond&#39;);&#10;      }&#10;    } else {&#10;      this.lastMs = nowMs;&#10;      this.seq = randomInt(0, 0xfff);&#10;    }&#10;    return this.assemble(nowMs, this.seq, randomUint62());&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  private assemble(ms: number, seq: number, randB: bigint): Uint8Array {&#10;    const out = new Uint8Array(16);&#10;    const ts = BigInt(ms);&#10;    out[0] = Number((ts &gt;&gt; 40n) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[1] = Number((ts &gt;&gt; 32n) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[2] = Number((ts &gt;&gt; 24n) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[3] = Number((ts &gt;&gt; 16n) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[4] = Number((ts &gt;&gt; 8n) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[5] = Number(ts &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    out[6] = 0x70 | ((seq &gt;&gt; 8) &amp; 0x0f);&#10;    out[7] = seq &amp; 0xff;&#10;    out[8] = 0x80 | Number((randB &gt;&gt; 56n) &amp; 0x3fn);&#10;    for (let i = 9; i &lt; 16; i++) {&#10;      out[i] = Number((randB &gt;&gt; BigInt((15 - i) * 8)) &amp; 0xffn);&#10;    }&#10;    return out;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> MonotonicUuidV7</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> lastMs</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  private</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\